(C℃m옏site","x":1058,"y":265,"width":247,"height":36},{"text":"Attribute)이라","x":1315,"y":266,"width":174,"height":32}]},{"text":"한다. 또한 나이, 성별 등의 속성은 더이상 다른 속성들로 구성될 수 없는 단순한 속성이므로 단순속성(SimpIe","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":192,"y":314,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"또한","x":267,"y":314,"width":53,"height":30},{"text":"나이,","x":333,"y":314,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"성별","x":403,"y":315,"width":48,"height":31},{"text":"등의","x":464,"y":315,"width":47,"height":30},{"text":"속성은","x":525,"y":314,"width":73,"height":31},{"text":"더이상","x":611,"y":314,"width":73,"height":31},{"text":"다른","x":696,"y":314,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"속성들로","x":757,"y":315,"width":104,"height":30},{"text":"구성될","x":872,"y":314,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"수","x":962,"y":315,"width":27,"height":29},{"text":"없는","x":1002,"y":315,"width":51,"height":29},{"text":"단순한","x":1066,"y":314,"width":75,"height":31},{"text":"속성이므로","x":1152,"y":313,"width":129,"height":31},{"text":"단순속성(SimpIe","x":1292,"y":313,"width":196,"height":37}]},{"text":"AttHbute)이라 한다.","words":[{"text":"AttHbute)이라","x":192,"y":363,"width":181,"height":33},{"text":"한다.","x":384,"y":364,"width":57,"height":30}]},{"text":"일반적으로 속성은 하나의 값을 가지고 있으나, 그 인에 동일한 성질의 여러 개의 값이 나타나는 경우가 있다.","words":[{"text":"일반적으로","x":227,"y":412,"width":130,"height":30},{"text":"속성은","x":368,"y":413,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"하나의","x":452,"y":412,"width":71,"height":30},{"text":"값을","x":536,"y":412,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"가지고","x":595,"y":412,"width":73,"height":30},{"text":"있으나,","x":679,"y":411,"width":80,"height":34},{"text":"그","x":771,"y":415,"width":26,"height":21},{"text":"인에","x":808,"y":411,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"동일한","x":870,"y":411,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"성질의","x":960,"y":411,"width":75,"height":31},{"text":"여러","x":1049,"y":412,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"개의","x":1112,"y":411,"width":47,"height":31},{"text":"값이","x":1173,"y":411,"width":48,"height":31},{"text":"나타나는","x":1234,"y":412,"width":100,"height":29},{"text":"경우가","x":1346,"y":411,"width":75,"height":31},{"text":"있다.","x":1431,"y":411,"width":54,"height":30}]},{"text":"이때 속성 하니에 한 개의 값을 가지는 경우를 단일값(Single value), 여러 개의 값을 가지는 경유를 다중값(Mulü","words":[{"text":"이때","x":192,"y":460,"width":50,"height":29},{"text":"속성","x":254,"y":460,"width":50,"height":30},{"text":"하니에","x":317,"y":461,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"한","x":402,"y":461,"width":25,"height":30},{"text":"개의","x":437,"y":461,"width":47,"height":30},{"text":"값을","x":496,"y":460,"width":48,"height":31},{"text":"가지는","x":553,"y":460,"width":73,"height":30},{"text":"경우를","x":636,"y":460,"width":71,"height":31},{"text":"단일값(Single","x":718,"y":459,"width":158,"height":36},{"text":"value),","x":886,"y":460,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"여러","x":988,"y":459,"width":48,"height":31},{"text":"개의","x":1050,"y":460,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"값을","x":1112,"y":460,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"가지는","x":1171,"y":459,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"경유를","x":1257,"y":459,"width":73,"height":31},{"text":"다중값(Mulü","x":1341,"y":459,"width":144,"height":32}]},{"text":"value) 속성이라 한다. 주민등록번호와 같은 속성은 반드시 하나의 값만 존재하므로 단일값속성(Single-Valued","words":[{"text":"value)","x":190,"y":510,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"속성이라","x":288,"y":509,"width":103,"height":31},{"text":"한다.","x":401,"y":509,"width":56,"height":30},{"text":"주민등록번호와","x":470,"y":509,"width":172,"height":30},{"text":"같은","x":652,"y":509,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"속성은","x":712,"y":508,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"반드시","x":798,"y":507,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"하나의","x":886,"y":507,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"값만","x":977,"y":507,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"존재하므로","x":1039,"y":508,"width":130,"height":30},{"text":"단일값속성(Single-Valued","x":1179,"y":507,"width":307,"height":34}]},{"text":"AttHbute)이라 한다. 어떤 사람의 전화번호와 같은 속성은 집, 휴대전화, 회사 전화번호와 같이 여러 개의 값을","words":[{"text":"AttHbute)이라","x":189,"y":557,"width":181,"height":32},{"text":"한다.","x":381,"y":557,"width":