t":32}]},{"text":"엔터티가 있을 때 학점이라는 속성의 도메인은 0.0에서4.0 사이의 실수 값이며, 주소라는 속성은 길이가 20자리","words":[{"text":"엔터티가","x":192,"y":1013,"width":103,"height":30},{"text":"있을","x":306,"y":1013,"width":48,"height":29},{"text":"때","x":366,"y":1012,"width":22,"height":30},{"text":"학점이라는","x":400,"y":1012,"width":125,"height":30},{"text":"속성의","x":535,"y":1013,"width":70,"height":30},{"text":"도메인은","x":618,"y":1013,"width":99,"height":30},{"text":"0.0에서4.0","x":727,"y":1013,"width":134,"height":30},{"text":"사이의","x":872,"y":1013,"width":73,"height":31},{"text":"실수","x":960,"y":1012,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"값이며,","x":1021,"y":1011,"width":83,"height":35},{"text":"주소라는","x":1117,"y":1013,"width":104,"height":30},{"text":"속성은","x":1230,"y":1013,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"길이가","x":1318,"y":1013,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"20자리","x":1405,"y":1012,"width":75,"height":30}]},{"text":"이내인 문자열로 정의할 수 있다. 여기서 물론 각 속성은 도메인 이외의 값을 갖지 못한다. 따라서 도메인을 종","words":[{"text":"이내인","x":192,"y":1061,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"문자열로","x":280,"y":1060,"width":101,"height":30},{"text":"정의할","x":394,"y":1061,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"수","x":478,"y":1061,"width":26,"height":29},{"text":"있다.","x":516,"y":1061,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"여기서","x":585,"y":1062,"width":70,"height":30},{"text":"물론","x":669,"y":1062,"width":50,"height":29},{"text":"각","x":730,"y":1061,"width":26,"height":30},{"text":"속성은","x":767,"y":1061,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"도메인","x":855,"y":1062,"width":75,"height":29},{"text":"이외의","x":945,"y":1060,"width":72,"height":31},{"text":"값을","x":1032,"y":1060,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"갖지","x":1096,"y":1061,"width":48,"height":30},{"text":"못한다.","x":1159,"y":1062,"width":83,"height":30},{"text":"따라서","x":1256,"y":1062,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"도메인을","x":1344,"y":1062,"width":103,"height":30},{"text":"종","x":1458,"y":1062,"width":25,"height":29}]},{"text":"더 이해하기 쉽게 정리하면, 엔터티 내에서 속성에 대한 데이터타입과 크가제약사항을 지정하는 것이다.","words":[{"text":"더","x":193,"y":